 ## Languages

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server uses the supported language with the
+highest positive quality value in `Accept-Language`, using header order
+for ties. A missing quality value defaults to 1. Regional tags such as
+`ko-KR` match their base language. If there is no supported preference,
+the server uses `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
